      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "\"This whole mess is just stirring up trouble where there was none before, plain and simple.\" \"They're bringing in all sorts of riff-raff, and it's starting to spoil the good order we've always had here.\" \"It's a nuisance, frankly; these new ideas are just nonsense from folks who don't know how things ought to run.\" \"We just need to keep our distance and make sure our own interests stay protected from all that foolishness.\"",
      "source": "target",
